    <code code="51848-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation note"/>
    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Recurrent disabling headaches since early adulthood, in bouts lasting days to weeks, now in the seventh day of a bout; under evaluation, with a two-week headache diary and a headache medicine consultation; no red flags: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Stiffness and weakness of the right wrist and hand after a dislocation that healed out of place in early middle age; writing is slow and painful after about an hour: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

